{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b7a1c2d3-e4f5-6789-abcd-ef0123456789",
    "name": "Gymora API",
    "description": "# Gymora API Postman Collection\n\n## Overview\n\nComplete Postman collection for the Gymora ASP.NET Core 9.0 REST API.\n\n## Architecture\n\n- **Authentication:** JWT Bearer Token with Refresh Tokens\n- **Identity:** ASP.NET Core Identity with `ApplicationUser` (int PK)\n- **Roles:** `SuperAdmin`, `User`\n- **Rate Limiting:** IP-based fixed window policies\n- **Global Exception Handling:** Custom middleware returning `Result<T>` envelope\n- **ORM:** Entity Framework Core with SQL Server\n- **Background Jobs:** Hangfire + MassTransit InMemory + EF Outbox\n- **File Storage:** Bunny.net (Stream + Storage)\n- **Payment:** Paymob integration\n- **Validation:** DataAnnotations\n\n## Token Variables\n\n| Variable | Description |\n|----------|-------------|\n| `accessToken` / `refreshToken` | Default tokens (set by Login) |\n| `superAdminAccessToken` / `superAdminRefreshToken` | SuperAdmin role tokens |\n| `userAccessToken` / `userRefreshToken` | User 1 role tokens |\n| `user2AccessToken` / `user2RefreshToken` | User 2 role tokens |\n\n> **Note:** All Users endpoints require SuperAdmin role. The collection auth uses `{{superAdminAccessToken}}`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "09 Users",
      "description": "User management — read-only listing and detail retrieval. All endpoints require SuperAdmin authorization.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Users (Paged)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Response is success\", () => {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.isSuccess).to.be.true;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Response has pagination fields\", () => {",
                  "    var data = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "    pm.expect(data).to.be.an('object');",
                  "    pm.expect(data.totalCount).to.be.a('number');",
                  "    pm.expect(data.pageSize).to.be.a('number');",
                  "    pm.expect(data.pageNumber).to.be.a('number');",
                  "    pm.expect(data.totalPages).to.be.a('number');",
                  "    pm.expect(data.hasPrevious).to.be.a('boolean');",
                  "    pm.expect(data.hasNext).to.be.a('boolean');",
                  "    pm.expect(data.items).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"pageNumber\": 1,\n  \"pageSize\": 10,\n  \"searchTerm\": null,\n  \"orderBy\": \"Id\",\n  \"orderDirection\": \"asc\",\n  \"isActive\": true,\n  \"createdById\": null,\n  \"filters\": null\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/Users",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "Users"]
            },
            "description": "Get a paginated list of users with optional search, sorting, and filtering.\n\n### Requires Roles: SuperAdmin"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get User by ID",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", () => {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Response is success\", () => {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.isSuccess).to.be.true;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"User has required fields\", () => {",
                  "    var data = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "    pm.expect(data).to.be.an('object');",
                  "    pm.expect(data.id).to.be.a('number');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/Users/{{createdEntityId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "Users", "{{createdEntityId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Get a single user by their ID.\n\n### Requires Roles: SuperAdmin"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
